:: StoryTitle
SugarCube Starter (Stats + Inventory + Audio)

:: StoryInit
/* Runs once at the beginning */
<<set $health = 10>>
<<set $score = 0>>
<<set $inventory = []>>
<<set $musicOn = false>>

/* Preload audio file (optional but recommended)
   Put your audio at: sounds/514942__shortrecord__horror-ambient-factory.mp3 */
<<cacheaudio "bgm" "sounds/514942__shortrecord__horror-ambient-factory.mp3">>

:: StoryCaption
/* Persistent HUD (always visible) */
''Health:'' $health  |  ''Score:'' $score  |  ''Items:'' $inventory.length
<br>

<<link "🎒 Inventory">>
  <<goto "Inventory">>
<</link>>
 |
<<link "❤️ Stats">>
  <<goto "Stats">>
<</link>>
 |
<<link "🔊 Music">>
  <<goto "Audio">>
<</link>>

<hr>

:: Start
Welcome! This starter story has:
- **Stats** ($health, $score)
- **Inventory** ($inventory array)
- **Audio toggle** (manual start required by browsers)
- A simple **HUD** at the top

You are in a small room. There’s a **shiny key** on a table and a door to the hallway.

<<if !$inventory.includes("Key")>>
<<link "Pick up the key">>
  <<set $inventory.push("Key")>>
  <<set $score += 5>>
  You picked up the Key. (+5 score)
<</link>>
<<else>>
You already grabbed the Key.
<</if>>

<br><br>

[[Open the door->DoorCheck]]
<br>
[[Step outside into the forest->Forest]]

:: DoorCheck
You try the door.

<<if $inventory.includes("Key")>>
The key fits! You unlock it.
<<set $score += 10>>
[[Enter the hallway->Hallway]]
<<else>>
It’s locked. You need a key.
[[Go back->Start]]
<</if>>

:: Hallway
A hallway stretches ahead. A trap plate is visible on the floor.

<<link "Carefully step over the trap plate">>
  <<set $score += 15>>
  Nice move. (+15 score)
  [[Continue->TreasureRoom]]
<</link>>

<br>

<<link "Sprint past it (risky)">>
  <<set $health -= 3>>
  Ouch—you got clipped. (-3 health)
  <<if $health <= 0>>
    [[...->GameOver]]
  <<else>>
    [[Stumble forward->TreasureRoom]]
  <</if>>
<</link>>

<br><br>
[[Back to start->Start]]

:: TreasureRoom
You find a small treasure room with a glowing coin.

<<if !$inventory.includes("GlowCoin")>>
<<link "Take the glowing coin">>
  <<set $inventory.push("GlowCoin")>>
  <<set $score += 50>>
  You got the GlowCoin! (+50 score)
<</link>>
<<else>>
The treasure chest is empty now.
<</if>>

<br><br>
[[Return to hallway->Hallway]]
<br>
[[Return to start->Start]]

:: Forest
You step into a forest. It’s calm… maybe too calm.

<<link "Rest for a moment">>
  <<set $health += 2>>
  You feel a bit better. (+2 health)
<</link>>

<br>

<<link "Explore deeper">>
  <<set $score += 20>>
  You discover a new path. (+20 score)
<</link>>

<br><br>
[[Go back inside->Start]]

:: Inventory
== Inventory ==
<<if $inventory.length === 0>>
You aren’t carrying anything.
<<else>>
<<for _item range $inventory>>
• _item<br>
<</for>>
<</if>>

<br>
[[Back->Start]]

:: Stats
== Stats ==
Health: $health<br>
Score: $score<br>

<br>
<<if $health <= 0>>
[[Go to Game Over->GameOver]]
<</if>>

[[Back->Start]]

:: Audio
== Music Toggle ==
Browsers usually require a click before audio will play.

<<if !$musicOn>>
<<link "🔊 Turn Music ON">>
  <<audio "bgm" loop play>>
  <<set $musicOn = true>>
  Music is ON.
<</link>>
<<else>>
<<link "🔇 Turn Music OFF">>
  <<audio "bgm" stop>>
  <<set $musicOn = false>>
  Music is OFF.
<</link>>
<</if>>

<br><br>
''Audio file path used:'' sounds/514942__shortrecord__horror-ambient-factory.mp3
<br>
(You can change this in StoryInit.)

<br><br>
[[Back->Start]]

:: GameOver
== Game Over ==
Your health hit 0.

Final Score: $score

<br>
<<link "Restart">>
  <<restart>>
<</link>>
